{"id":"n20199-1-20","stage":1,"title":"떡 · 糕","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n20199-1-20-1","ko":"엄마, 식탁 위에 있는 떡은 웬 거예요?","zh":"妈妈，桌子上的年糕是哪儿来的呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"식탁","meaning":"餐桌","explanation":"식탁：餐桌","readings":[{"term":"식탁","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26869","senseId":"1","lemma":"식탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위에","meaning":"上","explanation":"위：上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71462","senseId":"3","lemma":"위","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在","explanation":"있다：在；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"8","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떡은","meaning":"糕，糕饼，糕点","explanation":"떡：糕，糕饼，糕点；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"떡","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20199","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"웬","meaning":"什么，哪儿来的","explanation":"웬：什么，哪儿来的","readings":[{"term":"웬","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69527","senseId":"1","lemma":"웬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거예요?","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"54440e480486cc26","term":"식탁","zh":"餐桌","audio":"/audio/54440e480486cc26718c.mp3","entryId":"26869","definition":"用于摆放食物、围坐起来用餐的桌子。","pronunciation":["식탁"]},{"id":"e0bebb354d8f7f3b","term":"위","zh":"上","audio":"/audio/e0bebb354d8f7f3b0c82.mp3","entryId":"71462","definition":"某东西的表面或平坦的表面。","pronunciation":["위"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"某物占有某处位置或空间。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"f7ea97e270cc40ef","term":"떡","zh":"糕，糕饼，糕点","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3","entryId":"20199","definition":"类似于打糕、松糕，将谷物磨成的粉蒸熟或煮熟后制成的食物。","pronunciation":["떡"]},{"id":"0eb778191ab3a0e5","term":"웬","zh":"什么，哪儿来的","audio":"/audio/0eb778191ab3a0e588b9.mp3","entryId":"69527","definition":"不知道怎么回事。","pronunciation":["웬ː"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/ca00bd48ec1f30bc7655.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n20199-1-20-2","ko":"어제 옆집으로 이사 온 아주머니가 동네 사람들에게 돌린 떡이야.","zh":"那是昨天搬到隔壁的阿姨分给邻居们的年糕啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옆집으로","meaning":"邻居，隔壁","explanation":"옆집：邻居，隔壁；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"옆집","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71723","senseId":"1","lemma":"옆집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이사","meaning":"搬家","explanation":"이사：搬家","readings":[{"term":"이사","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71138","senseId":"1","lemma":"이사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"온","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아주머니가","meaning":"大嫂，大妈，阿姨","explanation":"아주머니：大嫂，大妈，阿姨；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아주머니","audio":"/audio/32bc34ce0694e2e28fc0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89820","senseId":"2","lemma":"아주머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동네","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들에게","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌린","meaning":"分给，分送","explanation":"돌리다：分给，分送；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"돌리다","audio":"/audio/6d22f9fa2b8915ddd6fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71457","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떡이야.","meaning":"糕，糕饼，糕点","explanation":"떡：糕，糕饼，糕点；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"떡","audio":"/audio/f7ea97e270cc40ef971e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20199","senseId":"1","lemma":"떡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"d4901559765ba929","term":"옆집","zh":"邻居，隔壁","audio":"/audio/d4901559765ba929833a.mp3","entryId":"71723","definition":"旁边的一家。","pronunciation":["엽찝"]},{"id":"925efb171a8616cc","term":"이사","zh":"搬家","audio":"/audio/925efb171a8616ccc70a.mp3","entryId":"71138","definition":"离开原先生活的地方，搬去别的地方。","pronunciation":["이사"]},{"i